8, "region": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 890469, "date": 1775779200, "platform": 169, "y": 2026, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 890470, "date": 1775779200, "platform": 167, "y": 2026, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 1456917, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scv85x.jpg"}, {"id": 1456918, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scv85y.jpg"}, {"id": 1456919, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scv85z.jpg"}, {"id": 1456920, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scv860.jpg"}, {"id": 1456921, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scv861.jpg"}, {"id": 1456922, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scv862.jpg"}], "slug": "tamashika", "summary": "The game is about keeping your mind at one place.\n\nPatterns in sensate experience reinforce an illusion of continuity. The dream is a construction of the mind that perpetuates the illusion.\n\nThe cartesian prison is a hall of mirrors, a recursive labyrinth. Each a reflection of me\u2014only patterns and processes.\n\nThe present moment is the only thing that is real\u2014focus. Chaotic attractors are seizing your attention. Don\u2019t push or pull at it.\n\nYou have to reduce model complexity, you must cultivate flow. The game is about keeping your mind at one place!\n\nConcentrate\u2026 and remember\u2026 Attention is all you need.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/tamashika", "videos": [{"id": 139325, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "JLZXOrDlpf4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JLZXOrDlpf4", "title": "TAMASHIKA - Reveal Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/JLZXOrDlpf4/sddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 159231, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "tFEJIfLnkpc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tFEJIfLnkpc", "title": "Tamashika - Official Gameplay Trailer | IGN Live 2025", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/